# Operator image context (APP-077). BuildKit reads this file for
# app/operator/Dockerfile instead of the root .dockerignore, so the service and
# qualification contexts are unchanged. Explicit allowlist of exactly the files
# the image packages: the operator entry and its documented overrides and lock,
# the migration runner/catalog verifier, seed, admission operator and provider
# client, every landed migration and catalog, the contract validator and the
# seeded edition's fixtures, the fixture-source adapter (qualify/verify), the
# manifest and the one fixture source it uploads, the RDS CA, and every tracked
# parser/ file (its manifest binds the parser bytes to exactly these sources).
# Never tests, stubs, credentials, evidence, caches, build output or operator state.
**
!app/operator/Dockerfile
!app/operator/Dockerfile.dockerignore
!app/operator/operator.py
!app/operator/overrides.json
!app/operator/requirements.lock
